Method Description <code>views()</code> Called at registration. Add Django Ninja routes with <code>@self.router.get(...)</code>, <code>@self.router.post(...)</code> and so on <code>on_before_operation(request, operation)</code> Runs before each sync <code>@action</code>. <code>operation</code> is the method name <code>aon_before_operation(request, operation)</code> Runs before each async <code>@action</code> <p>The hooks don't run for routes added in <code>views()</code>.</p> Python<pre><code>@api.view(prefix="/health", tags=["Health"])
class HealthView(APIView):
    def views(self):
        @self.router.get("/version")
        def version(request):
            return {"version": "1.0"}
</code></pre>

Python<pre><code>router = NinjaAIORouter()


